ISSUE: jestjs/jest#15826: [Bug]: Cleanup logic (globalTeardown, process.on signals) is not executed with bail=true

### Version

30.1.3

### Steps to reproduce

1. clone my repo [https://github.com/kopkaa/jest-bail-globalteardown-repro](https://github.com/kopkaa/jest-bail-globalteardown-repro)
2. `npm install`
3. `npm run test`

### Expected behavior

When `bail: true` is enabled and a test fails, Jest should still:

- call globalTeardown
- execute any `process.on('exit' | 'SIGINT' | 'SIGTERM' …) handlers`

In other words: cleanup logic should always run, regardless of bail.

